 Telex, VNI, free tone placement, Quick Telex, live spell-check, automatic
 English restore and context-aware decisions.
 .
 This package adds "Tools..." to the input method menu: add Vietnamese tones
 to unaccented selected text ("toi di hoc" becomes "tôi đi học"), UPPERCASE,
 lowercase, Title Case, Sentence case and remove tones. It also computes the
 suggestions shown next to the caret while typing: math results, money
